#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel a warm sense of being at home."
msgstr "Vous ressentez un sentiment chaleureux d'être chez vous."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a weight you didn't know you had on you, being lifted "
"away."
msgstr ""
"Vous sentiez un poids, dont vous ignorez l'existence, soudainement "
"disparaître."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel wakeful and energized, as if something that was slowing "
"you down is now gone."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous sentez soudainement éveillé et plein d'énergie, comme si quelque "
"chose qui vous ralentissait avait disparu."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel as if invisible shackles are being lifted away…"
msgstr ""
"Vous avez soudain l'impression qu'on vous enlève des chaînes invisibles..."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Everything suddenly feels more clear."
msgstr "Tout semble soudain plus clair."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel like you shouldn't be here."
msgstr "Vous avez soudainement le sentiment que vous ne devriez pas être ici."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You try to recall what you were about to do, but you can't focus…"
msgstr ""
"Vous essayez de vous rappeler ce que vous étiez sur le point de faire, mais "
"vous n'arrivez plus à vous concentrer..."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel feeble.  Your muscles wobble."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez soudainement faible. Vos muscles vacillent."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a sharp pain in your hand.  You reach out to grab it, and "
"miss."
msgstr ""
"Vous ressentez soudainement une douleur aiguë dans votre main. Vous tendez "
"la main pour la retirer, et vous la ratez."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You blink one time, and everything seems bigger."
msgstr "Vous clignez des yeux une fois, et tout vous semble plus grand."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You stop to think, but you can't seem to remember about what."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous arrêtez pour réfléchir, mais vous n'arrivez pas à vous souvenir de"
" quoi."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel anxious for no reason."
msgstr "Vous vous sentez anxieux sans raison."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel as if your stomach and its contents are fighting."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez soudainement l'impression que votre estomac et son contenu se "
"battent."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "For a brief moment, you feel rejected by the world."
msgstr "Pendant un bref instant, vous vous sentez rejeté par le monde."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Gravity suddenly exerts immense pressure, forcing you to the ground!"
msgstr ""
"La gravité exerce soudainement une immense pression, vous plaquant au sol !"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your vision suddenly fills with cold sparks.  You feel so alone…"
msgstr ""
"Votre vision s'emplit soudainement de froide et triste étincelles froides. "
"Vous vous sentez si seul..."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your body as you suffer with every action you take, as"
" if you weren't intended to do them."
msgstr ""
"De faibles étincelles entourent votre corps alors que chaque action que vous"
" entreprenez vous font souffrir, comme si vous n'étiez pas destiné à les "
"faire."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Faint sparks suddenly appear and disappear around you, as if rejecting your "
"very existence.  Pain flares across your body."
msgstr ""
"De faibles étincelles apparaissent et disparaissent soudainement autour de "
"vous, comme si elles rejetaient votre existence même. Une douleur se répand "
"violemment dans votre corps."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly register a buzzing in your senses.  It's getting louder, and "
"your head starts to throb.  Something is coming."
msgstr ""
"Vous percevez soudain un bourdonnement dans vos sens. Il devient de plus en "
"plus fort, et votre tête commence à vibrer. Quelque chose arrive."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Reality is breaking!"
msgstr "La réalité se brise !"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As suddenly as it began, the portal storm fades.  Reality returns to normal."
"  Hopefully the scarring is minimal…"
msgstr ""
"Aussi soudainement qu'elle a commencé, la tempête du portail s'estompe. La "
"réalité revient à la normale. Espérons que les cicatrices soient minimes..."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You awake with a start from what must have been a violent and horrifying "
"daydream.  Your body aches as if the wounds were real."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous réveillez en sursaut de ce qui a dû être un rêve violent et "
"horrifiant. Votre corps vous fait mal comme si les blessures étaient "
"réelles."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A million tiny pinpricks in space open for an instant, and smoke fills the "
"air."
msgstr ""
"Un million de petites entailles dans l'espace s'ouvrent pendant un instant, "
"et la fumée remplit l'air."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The moment feels thick, as if it's not quite over."
msgstr "Le moment semble dense, comme s'il n'était pas tout à fait terminé."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You feel stretched, as if part of you was elsewhere.  You are not solid "
"enough to affect matter, and your equipment falls through you."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous sentez étiré, comme si une partie de vous était ailleurs. Vous "
"n'êtes pas assez solide pour agir sur la matière, et votre équipement vous "
"traverse."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You are trapped in <global_val:place_name>!"
msgstr "Vous êtes piégés dans <global_val:place_name> !"

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You can feel the presence of something nearby, cracked in a way you can't "
"put into words(check mission log for details)."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez sentir la présence de quelque chose à proximité, fissurée d'une "
"manière que vous ne pouvez pas mettre en mots (vérifiez le journal de "
"mission pour plus de détails)."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Weren't you just here? It feel thicker somehow though."
msgstr ""
"Vous n'étiez pas juste là ? Ça semble plus épais d'une certaine façon."

#. ~ Message about the player in an effect
#: data/json/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A strange item comes back with you."
msgstr "Un objet étrange revient avec vous."

