#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Veteran"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've served in the armed forces and after being discharged from the army, "
"you're sent to take medical treatment in one of the health care centers.  "
"Just when you thought you've overcome your war-time traumas and readjusted "
"to the normal life, the world has come to and end and your worst nightmare "
"has become a reality: living in an hellish battlefield."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez servi dans les forces armées et après avoir été démobilisé, on "
"vous envoie suivre un traitement médical dans un centre de soin. Alors que "
"vous pensiez avoir surmonté vos traumatismes de guerre et vous être réadapté"
" à la vie normale, le monde a pris fin et votre pire cauchemar est devenu "
"réalité: vivre dans un champ de bataille infernal."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Veteran"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Military Veteran" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've served in the armed forces and after being discharged from the army, "
