#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "Fusilier"

#. ~ Description of profession "Rifleman" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr ""
"Quand vous étiez jeune, vous rêviez d'être un soldat. La guerre c'est "
"l'enfer et l'enfer c'est la guerre, mais vous n'avez jamais pensé que ça se "
"passerait comme ça."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
