#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Navy SEAL"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm you used to be a member of the SEALs: a key component "
"of the US Navy’s special forces contingent, a highly trained soldier in all "
"respects, and a proficient combatant in both maritime and ground operations."
"  Called upon to eliminate high-value targets and conduct specialised marine"
" missions, the greatest test of your capabilities now rests before you.  "
"'The only easy day was yesterday', and now its time to square your shoulders"
" and embark on your last and hardest mission to date."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Navy SEAL"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Navy SEAL" for female
