#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Martial Artist"
msgstr "Expert en arts martiaux"

#. ~ Description of profession "Martial Artist" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"'Drop the martial arts!', they said.  'Learn a skill for the REAL world!', "
"they said.  Well, you're about to show them!  SHOW THEM ALL!"
msgstr ""
"'Laisse tomber les arts martiaux!', qu'ils disaient. 'Apprends quelque chose"
" de plus utile!', qu'ils disaient. Bien, vous allez leur montrer! LEUR "
"MONTRER A TOUS!"

