msgid "Black Belt"
msgstr "Ceinture Noire"

#. ~ Description of profession "Black Belt" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As the world ends, you alone stand against the coming darkness with your "
"fists of steel."
msgstr ""
"C'est la fin du monde et vous êtes seul contre les ténèbres avec vos poings "
"d'acier."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
