msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ahistorical Reenactor"
msgstr "Inventeur d'histoires"

#. ~ Description of profession "Ahistorical Reenactor" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on your way to the Annual All New England Revolutionary War Living "
"History exhibition when the end of the world made traditional gender roles "
"obsolete."
msgstr ""
"Vous vous rendiez à un meeting annuel sur l'histoire de la révolution "
"Anglaise quand la fin du monde a complètement déjoué vos prévisions."

