#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_melee"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Melee skills"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_ranged"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Ranged skills"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_crafting"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Crafting skills"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Display string for skill display type "display_interaction"
#: data/json/skillDisplayType.json
msgid "Interaction skills"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "social"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "social"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in speaking to other people.  Covers ability in boasting, "
"flattery, threats, persuasion, lies, bartering, and other facets of "
"interpersonal communication.  Works best in conjunction with a high level of"
" intelligence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "computers"
msgstr "informatique"

#. ~ Description of skill "computers"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in accessing and manipulating computers.  Higher levels can allow"
" a user to navigate complex software systems and even bypass their security."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à utiliser les ordinateurs. Les niveaux plus élevés vous "
"permettent d'utiliser les logiciels les plus complexes et vous pourriez même"
" pirater leur sécurité."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "health care"
msgstr "soins médicaux"

#. ~ Description of skill "health care"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in effecting medical treatment.  Higher levels allow better use "
"of medicines and items like bandages and first aid kits, and reduce the "
"failure and complication rates of medical procedures."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "mechanics"
msgstr "mécanique"

#. ~ Description of skill "mechanics"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in engineering, maintaining and repairing vehicles and other "
"mechanical systems.  This skill covers the craft of items with complex "
"parts, and plays a role in the installation of bionic equipment."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence pour entretenir et réparer des véhicules et divers systèmes"
" mécaniques. Elle vous permet de fabriquer des objets aux pièces complexes, "
"et joue un rôle dans l'installation des équipements bioniques."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "devices"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "devices"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in manipulating fine devices like security systems, traps, locks "
"and other precision tasks.  This skill does not affect the evasion of traps "
"that are triggered."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "vehicles"
msgstr "véhicules"

#. ~ Description of skill "vehicles"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in operating and steering a vehicle in motion, from cars and "
"boats to helicopters and hot air balloons.  A higher level allows greater "
"control over vehicles at higher speeds, and reduces the penalty of shooting "
"while driving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "athletics"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "athletics"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your athletic ability, including swimming endurance and ability to swim with"
" weight.  Athletic skill also improves your overall cardio fitness and "
"stamina."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "fabrication"
msgstr "fabrication"

#. ~ Description of skill "fabrication"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in working with raw materials and shaping them into useful "
"objects.  This skill plays an important role in the crafting of many "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à travailler les matériaux bruts et à les assembler pour en"
" faire des objets plus utiles. Cette compétence permet de fabriquer de "
"nombreux objets."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "food handling"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "food handling"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in combining food ingredients to make other, tastier food items."
"  Also includes food preservation and safety, brewing, butchery, and more."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "tailoring"
msgstr "couture"

#. ~ Description of skill "tailoring"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in the craft and repair of clothing, bags, blankets and other "
"textiles.  Affects knitting, sewing, stitching, weaving, and nearly anything"
" else involving a needle and thread."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence pour fabriquer et réparer vêtements, sacs, couvertures et "
"autres textiles. Tricot, tissage, couture, tout ce qui implique du fil et "
"une aiguille est à votre portée."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "survival"
msgstr "survie"

#. ~ Description of skill "survival"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in surviving the wilderness, and in crafting various basic "
"survival items.  This also covers your ability to skin and butcher animals "
"for meat and hides."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à faire face à la vie sauvage et à fabriquer des objets "
"simples de survie. Cela vous permet également de dépeucer et mettre en "
"pièces les animaux pour récupérer leurs peaux et leur viande."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "electronics"
msgstr "électronique"

#. ~ Description of skill "electronics"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in dealing with electrical systems, used in the craft and repair "
"of objects with electrical components.  This skill is an important part of "
"installing and managing bionic implants."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à fabriquer et réparer des objets électriques. Cette "
"compérence joue un grand rôle pour l'installation et la gestion des implants"
" bioniques."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "archery"
msgstr "tir à l'arc"

#. ~ Description of skill "archery"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in using bow weapons, from hand-carved self bows to complex "
"compound bows.  Quiet and effective, they require strength of body and sight"
" to wield, and are not terribly accurate over a long distance."
msgstr ""
"Votre habileté à utiliser des armes de type arc, des auto-arcs sculptés à la"
" main aux arcs à poulies complexes. Calmes et efficaces, ils exigent force "
"de force et vue, et ne sont pas très précis sur une longue distance."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "marksmanship"
msgstr "adresse au tir"

#. ~ Description of skill "marksmanship"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your overall skill in using bows and firearms.  With higher levels, this "
"general experience increases accuracy with any bows or firearms, but is "
"secondary to practice with the type of ranged weapon in question."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence pour mieux viser avec les arcs et les armes à feu. Les "
"niveaux les plus élevés augmentent la précision des arcs et armes à feu, "
"mais il vous faut également pratiquer la compétence du type d'arme que vous "
"utilisez."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "launchers"
msgstr "armes lourdes"

#. ~ Description of skill "launchers"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in using heavy weapons like rocket, grenade or missile launchers."
"  These weapons have a variety of applications and may carry immense "
"destructive power, but they are cumbersome and hard to manage."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence pour utiliser les roquettes, grenades ou autres lance "
"missiles. Ces armes à l'immense pouvoir destructeur sont bien souvent "
"encombrantes et difficiles à gérer."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "handguns"
msgstr "pistolets"

#. ~ Description of skill "handguns"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Handguns have poor accuracy compared to rifles, but are usually quick to "
"fire and reload faster than other guns.  They are very effective at close "
"quarters, though unsuited for long range engagement."
msgstr ""
"Les pistolets sont moins précis que les fusils mais bien souvent plus "
"rapides à tirer et à recharger. Ils sont très efficaces à courte portée, "
"mais ne sont pas fait pour des combats à longue portée."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "rifles"
msgstr "fusils"

#. ~ Description of skill "rifles"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Classic rifles have terrific range and accuracy compared to other firearms, "
"but may be slow to fire and reload, and can prove difficult to use in in "
"close combat.  Short-barreled rifles and carbines are more like SMGs and "
"performs well in close combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "shotguns"
msgstr "fusils à pompe"

#. ~ Description of skill "shotguns"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Shotguns are easy to shoot and can inflict massive damage, but their "
"effectiveness and accuracy decline rapidly with range.  Slugs can be loaded "
"into shotguns to provide greater range, though they are somewhat inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"Les fusils à pompe font d'énormes dégâts à courte portée, mais leur "
"efficacité diminue très vite a portée plus grande. On peut y charger des "
"balles pour augmenter la portée mais la précision s'en trouve réduite."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "submachine guns"
msgstr "pistolets mitrailleurs"

#. ~ Description of skill "submachine guns"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Comprised of an automatic rifle carbine designed to fire a pistol cartridge,"
" submachine guns can reload and fire quickly, sometimes in bursts, but they "
"are relatively inaccurate and may be prone to mechanical failures."
msgstr ""
"Constituées d'un fusil automatique conçu pour tirer des balles de pistolet, "
"les pistolets mitrailleurs se rechargent et tirent rapidement, certains en "
"rafale, mais sont assez imprécis et peuvent être sujet à des défaillances "
"mécaniques."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "throwing"
msgstr "lancer"

#. ~ Description of skill "throwing"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in throwing objects over a distance.  Skill increases accuracy, "
"and at higher levels, the range of a throw."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à lancer des objets à distance. Les premiers niveaux "
"augmentent la précision, et les niveaux les plus élevés augementent la "
"portée."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "melee"
msgstr "mêlée"

#. ~ Description of skill "melee"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill and finesse in personal combat, both with and without a weapon.  "
"Higher levels can significantly increase the accuracy and effectiveness of "
"your physical attacks."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence au combat rapproché, avec ou sans arme. Les niveaux les "
"plus élevés peuvent nettement accroitre la précision et l'efficacité de vos "
"coups."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "bashing weapons"
msgstr "armes contondantes"

#. ~ Description of skill "bashing weapons"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with blunt weaponry, from rocks and sticks to "
"baseball bats and the butts of rifles.  Skill increases damage, and higher "
"levels will improve the accuracy of an attack."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à manier les armes contondantes. Une simple pierre, une "
"batte de baseball ou même la crosse d'un fusil. Les niveaux plus élevés "
"augmentent les dégâts et la précision des attaques."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "cutting weapons"
msgstr "armes tranchantes"

#. ~ Description of skill "cutting weapons"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with weaponry designed to cut, hack and slash an "
"opponent.  Lower levels of skill increase accuracy and damage, while higher "
"levels will help to bypass heavy armor and thick hides."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence à manier les armes conçues pour couper, entailler et "
"taillader vos adversaires. Les premiers niveaux vous permettent d'augmenter "
"la précision et les dégâts, tandis que les niveaux les plus élevés "
"permettent de passer au travers des armures et des peaux les plus robustes."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "dodging"
msgstr "esquive"

#. ~ Description of skill "dodging"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your ability to dodge an oncoming threat, be it an enemy's attack, a "
"triggered trap, or a falling rock.  This skill is also used in attempts to "
"fall gracefully, and for other acrobatic feats.  The first number shown "
"includes modifiers, and the second does not."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "piercing weapons"
msgstr "armes perçantes"

#. ~ Description of skill "piercing weapons"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in fighting with knives, spears and other such stabbing "
"implements.  Skill increases attack accuracy as well as the chance of "
"inflicting a deadly and critical blow."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence au combat avec les couteaux, les lances et autres armes de "
"type poignard. Les niveaux les plus élevés augmentent la précision et la "
"chance d'infliger des coups critiques voire mortels."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "unarmed combat"
msgstr "combat mains nues"

#. ~ Description of skill "unarmed combat"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in hand-to-hand fighting.  For the unskilled, it's a good way to "
"get hurt, but those with enough practice can perform special blows and "
"techniques to quickly dispatch enemies."
msgstr ""
"Votre compétence au combat à mains nues. Avec un niveau élevé cette "
"compétence peux vous permettre de délivrer des coups spéciaux pour "
"neutraliser rapidement un adversaire."

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "applied science"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of skill "applied science"
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid ""
"Your skill in general 'bench science', applying any of a wide range of "
"precision techniques based on your overall understanding of scientific "
"principles.  This is not a research skill, but about using the results of "
"others' research."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Skill name
#: data/json/skills.json
msgid "weapon"
msgstr "arme"

