#. ~ Description of "backgammon set"
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
msgid ""
"A very nice dark wooden box containing all the pieces needed to play a game "
"of backgammon, and also a extremely small handwritten guide of how to play "
"it.  Backgammon is a two-player board game played with counters and dice on "
"table boards.  The objective of the game is to move the fifteen pieces "
"around the board and be first to remove them from the board"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/fluff.json
