msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It is possibly one of the last "
"issues printed before New England was overwhelmed.  Most of the information "
"on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye"
" briefly."
msgstr ""
"Une simple page de journal. C'est probablement l'une des dernière à avoir "
"été imprimée avant que la nouvelle Angleterre soit envahie. La plupart des "
"informations sont sans importance, ou dépassées, mais une chose attire votre"
" oeil brièvement."

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/newspaper.json
msgid ""
"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It seems to date from several years"
" ago, and you've NO idea how it lasted this long.  Most of the information "
"on there is terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye"
" briefly."
msgstr ""
"Une simple page de journal. Il semble daté de plusieurs années et vous vous "
"demandez comment il a pu tenir aussi longtemps. La plupart des informations "
"sont sans importance, ou dépassées, mais une chose attire votre oeil "
"brièvement."

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
#: data/json/items/newspaper.json
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/items/newspaper.json
