"A single sheet of newspaper broadsheet.  It seems to date from a few years "
"ago--amazing it has lasted this long.  Most of the information on there is "
"terribly trivial, or out of date, but one thing catches your eye briefly."
msgstr ""
"Une simple page de journal. Il semble daté de plusieurs années. "
"Impressionant qu'il ai pu tenir aussi longtemps. La plupart des informations"
" sont sans importance, ou dépassées, mais une chose attire votre oeil "
"brièvement."

#. ~ Description of "newspaper page"
