#: data/json/items/ammo/223.json
msgid ""
"5.56x45mm ammunition with a 62gr FMJ bullet containing a steel penetrator.  "
"Originally designed for the M249 FN Minimi, M855 was designed to penetrate "
"steel helmets and light cover at range, sacrificing terminal performance and"
" accuracy in the process.  The limited yaw and fragmentation is worsened "
"with shorter-barreled carbines shooting this round, and optimization of "
"barrel twist for stabilization of the tracer variant of M855 has resulted in"
" lackluster accuracy overall."
