msgstr[2] "Ruger 10/22"

#. ~ Description of gun "Ruger 10/22"
#: data/json/items/gun/22.json
msgid ""
"A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive "
"ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small"
" game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly "
"capable of killing."
msgstr ""
"Le Ruger 10/22 propose un recul négligeable, une grande personnalisation, et"
" un coût réduit en munitions. Même s'il ne tire que des cartouches de .22, "
"il est parfaitement capable de tuer."

