#. ~ Description of gun "flamethrower"
#: data/json/items/gun/flammable.json
msgid ""
"A large flamethrower with substantial gas reserves.  Very menacing and "
"deadly."
msgstr ""
"Un grand lance-flammes avec d'importantes réserves de gaz. Très menaçant et "
"mortel."

