msgstr[0] "lance-flammes RM451"
msgstr[1] "lance-flammes RM451"
msgstr[2] "lance-flammes RM451"

#. ~ Description of gun "RM451 flamethrower"
#: data/json/items/gun/flammable.json
msgid ""
"A military-grade combat flamethrower designed by Rivtech, the RM451 "
"flamethrower incorporates a cycling pressure rapid-feed fuel system with a "
"high-speed piezoelectric igniter.  Solidly built with durability in mind, it"
" serves as an incredibly destructive weapon in the right hands."
msgstr ""
"Un lance-flammes de combat militaire fabriqué par Rivtech. Le RM451 intègre "
"un système d'alimentation en combustible à haute pression et un allumeur "
"rapide à piézoélectricité. Très solide, c'est une arme destructrice entre "
"les bonnes mains."

