#: data/json/items/tool/workshop.json
msgid ""
"This battery-powered tool, commonly known by the generic trademark Sawzall, "
"uses an electric motor to push a straight sawblade back and forth to rapidly"
" cut wood or metal.  It is useful for heavy demolition and construction "
"work, but is poorly suited to precision tasks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
