msgstr[1] "chauves-souris"
msgstr[2] "chauves-souris"

#. ~ Description of monster "bat"
#. ~ Description of monster "giant bat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/bloodsuckers.json
msgid ""
"One of the vesper bats, a family of winged insect-eating mammals.  It roosts"
" in caves and other hollows, and uses a form of echolocation to aerially "
"navigate through tricky terrain at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"L'une des espèces de chauve-souris vespérales, des mammifères volants "
"mangeurs d'insectes. Elles s'installent dans les cavernes et les caves, et "
"utilisent une forme d'écholocation pour se diriger à vive allure dans un "
"environnement accidenté."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "black bear cub"
msgid_plural "black bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "ourson noir"
msgstr[1] "oursons noirs"
msgstr[2] "oursons noirs"

#. ~ Description of monster "black bear cub"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile American black bear.  This one isn't much of a threat, but be "
"wary of its parent; black bears are known for their protectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Un ours noir juvénile. Bien qu'il ne soit pas vraiment très dangereux, "
"prenez gare à sa mère très protectrice probablement dans les environs."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "black bear"
msgid_plural "black bears"
msgstr[0] "ours noir"
msgstr[1] "ours noirs"
msgstr[2] "ours noirs"

#. ~ Description of monster "black bear"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The American black bear.  A large omnivorous scavenger, it has powerful "
"claws and jaws, and is an effective ambush hunter.  Most individuals are shy"
" around humans, but they're fiercely protective of their cubs."
msgstr ""
"L'ours noir d'Amérique. Un imposant omnivore doté d'une mâchoire et des "
"griffes puissantes en faisant un chasseur d'embuscade efficace. Bien qu'il "
"soit assez redoutable pour poser un réel danger à l'homme, il préfère "
"l'éviter généralement."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "beaver"
msgid_plural "beavers"
msgstr[0] "castor"
msgstr[1] "castors"
msgstr[2] "castors"

#. ~ Description of monster "beaver"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"The North American beaver, the continent's largest rodent.  Its paddle-"
"shaped tail helps ferry it through the water, and its prominent teeth can "
"chew through wood, which it uses to build dam-like nests in lakes and "
"streams."
msgstr ""
"Le castor du Canada, le plus gros rongeur du continent. Sa queue en forme de"
" pagaie l'aide à nager; ses dents peuvent couper du bois qu'il utilise pour "
"fabriquer des nids en forme de barrages sur les lacs et cours d'eau."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "black rat"
msgid_plural "black rats"
msgstr[0] "rat noir"
msgstr[1] "rats noirs"
msgstr[2] "rats noirs"

#. ~ Description of monster "black rat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid ""
"The black rat, an omnivorous rodent with sheer black fur and a long, rough "
"tail.  Harbinger of pestilence, famine, and mange, it will sometimes swarm "
"over the dead or dying."
msgstr ""
"Le rat noir, un rongeur omnivore avec une fine fourrure noir et une longue "
"queue rêche. Signe avant-coureur de la peste, de la famine et de la gale, "
"les rats déferlent parfois en groupe sur les cadavres ou les mourants."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "lab rat"
msgid_plural "lab rats"
msgstr[0] "rat de laboratoire"
msgstr[1] "rats de laboratoire"
msgstr[2] "rats de laboratoire"

#. ~ Description of monster "lab rat"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid ""
"The albino Norway rat, an omnivorous rodent with sleek white fur and a long,"
" rough tail.  While its ancestors were harbingers of plague, these clever "
"animals are omnipresent in modern biomedical research."
msgstr ""
"Le rat norvégien albino, un rongeur omnivore doté d'un pelage blanc lisse et"
" d'une longue queue nue. Bien que ces ancêtres furent des présages de "
"pestilence, ces animaux intelligents sont omniprésent dans la recherche "
"médicale moderne."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "wild boar piglet"
msgid_plural "wild boar piglets"
msgstr[0] "marcassin"
msgstr[1] "marcassins"
msgstr[2] "marcassins"

#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar piglet"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed "
"between the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the "
"domesticated pig gone feral in the wilderness.  This one is just a baby, and"
" is surprisingly cute."
msgstr ""
"Originairement pas natif au Etats-Unis, cet omnivore sauvage est un hybride "
"de sangliers sauvages s’étant échappés de réserves de chasse et de cochons "
"domestiques retournes a l'état sauvage"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/mammal.json
msgid "wild boar"
msgid_plural "wild boars"
msgstr[0] "sanglier"
msgstr[1] "sangliers"
msgstr[2] "sangliers"

#. ~ Description of monster "wild boar"
#: data/json/monsters/mammal.json
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the U.S., this wild omnivore is a crossbreed "
"between the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the "
"domesticated pig gone feral in the wilderness.  Its population has "
"skyrocketed during the last few decades."
msgstr ""

