msgstr[1] "chirurgiens mi-go"
msgstr[2] "chirurgiens mi-go"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go surgeon"
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This mi-go has a slender body with snaking carapace along it, and even more "
"paired clawed appendages.  Its claws are smaller and more delicate looking, "
"but that does not make them less unnerving."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go guard"
msgid_plural "mi-go guards"
msgstr[0] "garde mi-go"
msgstr[1] "gardes mi-go"
msgstr[2] "gardes mi-go"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go guard"
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"A more heavily armored version of the common mi-go.  Its trunk is a "
"shapeless mass of strange flesh encased in an iridescent carapace, from "
"which sprout several appendages terminating in what appear to be devices of "
"some sort.  Its pyramidal head is encrusted in barnacle-like armor, aside "
"from the bristling antennae that serve as its - you assume - sensory devices"
" and mouth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go myrmidon"
msgid_plural "mi-go myrmidons"
msgstr[0] "myrmidon mi-go"
msgstr[1] "myrmidons mi-go"
msgstr[2] "myrmidons mi-go"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go myrmidon"
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This creature resembles the smaller mi-go like a grizzly bear resembles a "
"human.  Its enormous, thick body is covered in an iridescent segmented "
"carapace, like a scarab crossed with an isopod.  It boasts several pairs of "
"deadly looking claws and other appendages, and it moves with a strange, slow"
" grace, like an otherworldly dancer.  It appears to be carrying weaponry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "partially harvested mi-go"
msgid_plural "partially harvested mi-gos"
msgstr[0] "mi-go partiellement démembré"
msgstr[1] "mi-go partiellement démembrés"
msgstr[2] "mi-go partiellement démembrés"

#. ~ Description of monster "partially harvested mi-go"
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This creature resembles the smaller mi-go like a grizzly bear resembles a "
"human.  Its enormous, thick body is covered in an iridescent segmented "
"carapace, like a scarab crossed with an isopod.  It has been mostly pulled "
"apart and is stuck to a surgical table that seems to be keeping it alive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "mi-go scout"
msgid_plural "mi-go scouts"
msgstr[0] "éclaireur mi-go"
msgstr[1] "éclaireurs mi-go"
msgstr[2] "éclaireurs mi-go"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go scout"
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid ""
"This slender mi-go is a little smaller than most others of its kind.  It has"
" a weird, oblong thing attached to the center of its body with some sort of "
"a diaphragm or a membrane on the end.  The thing seems like an integral part"
" of the mi-go's body, and all its appendages are supporting it to prevent "
"swaying."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mi-go scout"
#: data/json/monsters/mi-go.json
msgid "The mi-go scout fires its weapon!"
msgstr ""

