#. ~ Description of monster "bullfrog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The American bullfrog, in its natural habitat.  It feeds on insects, mice, "
"lizards and any other living thing it can stuff down its gullet."
msgstr ""
"La grenouille taureau américaine, dans son habitat naturel. Elles se "
"nourrissent d'insectes, souris, lézards et des autres choses vivantes "
"qu'elles peuvent faire passer dans son gosier."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "tadpole"
msgid_plural "tadpole"
