msgstr "On devrait peut-être commencer par barricader cet endroit."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"I suppose getting a car up and running should really be useful if we have to"
" disappear quickly from here."
msgstr ""
"Je pense que trouver une voiture en état de rouler pourrait être très utile "
"si on doit partir d'ici rapidement."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We could look for one of those farms out here.  They can provide plenty of "
"food and aren't close to the cities."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We should probably stay away from those cities, even if there's plenty of "
"useful stuff there."
msgstr ""
"On devrait rester loin des villes, même s'il y a plein de choses à y "
"trouver."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Hmm, okay."
msgstr "Hum, ok."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr "Merci !"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Focus on the road, mate!"
msgstr "Concentre toi sur la route!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I must focus on the road!"
msgstr "Je dois me concentrer sur la route!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too thirsty, give me something to drink."
msgstr "Je meurs de soif, donne-moi quelque chose à boire."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too hungry, give me something to eat."
msgstr "Je meurs de faim, donne-moi quelque chose à manger."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "Je suis trop fatigué, laisse-moi me reposer d'abord."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Nothing comes to my mind now.  Ask me later perhaps?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for not telling you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Ah, okay."
msgstr "Ah, d'accord."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not until I get some antibiotics…"
msgstr "Pas avant que j'ai des antibiotiques."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You asked me recently; ask again later."
msgstr "Tu m'as demandé récemment, demande plus tard."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "Pourquoi je voyagerais avec toi?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "C'est compris. Je rapporte les antibiotiques."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Right, right, I'll ask later."
msgstr "Oui ok, je demanderai plus tard."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can keep you safe."
msgstr "Je peux assurer ta sécurité."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You can keep me safe."
msgstr "Tu peux assurer ma sécurité."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll kill you if you don't."
msgstr "Je vous tue si vous n'obéissez pas."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You got it, I'm with you!"
msgstr "Ok ça me va, je te suis!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr "Super!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's go!"
msgstr "Ok, allons-y!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Yeah… I don't think so."
msgstr "Mouais... je ne crois pas non."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que c'est ?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return Barry to Eddie at the dairy."
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/isherwood_farm/NPC_Barry_Isherwood.json
msgid "How much further?"
msgstr "C'est encore loin?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd like to lead for a while."
msgstr "J'aimerais nous guider un moment."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Step aside.  I'm leader now."
msgstr "Écarte toi. C'est moi qui mène maintenant."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright.  You can lead now."
msgstr "D'accord, ouvre le chemin."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "Cool. Autre chose..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's go."
msgstr "D'accord, partons."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "Ok, ok."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, show me how it's done."
msgstr "Ok, montre moi comment c'est fait."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, let's begin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay.  Lead the way."
msgstr "D'accord ouvre le chemin."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "Non, je suis bien ici."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "On second thought, never mind."
msgstr "Tout bien réfléchi, ça m'est égal."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, who should participate?"
msgstr "Ok, qui doit participer?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Let's see…"
msgstr "Voyons voir..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Alright, let's begin."
msgstr "D'accord, c'est parti."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "Ça me va."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while you're operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Je ne peux pas vous former correctement pendant que vous conduisez!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't train you properly while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "Je ne peux pas vous former correctement et conduire en même temps!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, I'll show you something new later…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason for denying you training."
msgstr "J'ai mes raisons pour mon refus de vous former."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid ""
"We'll talk about a training seminar after you're done operating that "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"On pourra parler d'un séminaire de formation quand vous aurez fini de "
"conduire."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I can't host a seminar while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr ""
"Je ne peux pas organiser un séminaire et conduire ce véhicule en même temps!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it some time, we'll talk about a training seminar later…"
msgstr "Donnez-moi un petit moment avant qu'on organise un autre séminaire."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I have some reason to refuse hosting a training seminar."
msgstr "J'ai mes raisons pour mon refus d'organiser un séminaire."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "Aucune chance, je vais être mis à l'écart!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "Bien."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'm on watch."
msgstr "Je suis à la bourre."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I need you to come with me."
msgstr "Il faut que vous veniez avec moi."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I really don't feel comfortable doing so…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give you some space."
msgstr "Je vais vous faire de la place."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'd prefer to keep that to myself."
msgstr "J'aimerais garder ça pour moi."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I understand…"
msgstr "Je comprends…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "You just asked me for stuff; ask later."
msgstr "Tu viens de me demander du matos, redemande moi plus tard."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "Pourquoi je partagerais mon équipement avec toi?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, fine."
msgstr "D'accord."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm holding a thermal detonator!"
msgstr "Parce que j'ai un détonateur thermique entre les mains!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Because I'm your friend!"
msgstr "Parce que je suis ton ami!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Well, I am helping you out…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "I'll give it back!"
msgstr "Je te le rendrai!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Give it to me, or else!"
msgstr "Donne le moi, sinon!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Eh, never mind."
msgstr "Oublie ça."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Never mind, I'll do without.  Bye."
msgstr "Oublie ça, je ferais sans. Au revoir."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Okay, here you go."
msgstr "Ok, voilà pour toi."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
