#. ~ Description of "supervisor jacket"
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
msgid ""
"A variant company jacket tailored to slightly recall a business suit, often "
"issued to low level managers.  Some might think it looks nicer, but it's "
"just as cheaply made."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/civilian_blue_collar.json
