#: data/mods/Aftershock/items/armor/exosuit/exosuit_melee.json
msgid ""
"A huge, multi-fuel powered saw with a diamond blade, mounted on an exosuit."
"  If it has fuel, it can be turned on to turn it into a powerful metal "
"cutting tool.  Heavy cables run from the module to a handheld trigger "
"mechanism."
msgstr ""

