"war.  Your call to arms arrived dead on arrival and already plastered in the"
" all-too vibrant gore of your squadmates.  In the midst of panic, you bugged"
" out lest you join the remnants of your friends.  Now it's up to your wits "
"and short years of training to keep you alive in this Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "C.R.I.T Janitor"
msgstr "Concierge CRIT"

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Janitor" for male
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"*Sigh* Your life has been a wreck.  Hopping place to place you finally found"
" a job at C.R.I.T… as a janitor of sorts.  The pay was good and you got some"
" sneak-peeks on some pretty cool stuff.  After all non-essential personnel "
"were purged you found yourself stuck with nothing but the uniform they gave "
"you and your job's sign-bonus equipment."
msgstr ""

