msgid "C.R.I.T Lone Wolf"
msgstr "Louve Solitaire C.R.I.T"

#. ~ Description of profession "C.R.I.T Lone Wolf" for female
#: data/mods/CRT_EXPANSION/scenarios/crt_classes.json
