msgid_plural "new order shields"
msgstr[0] "bouclier du nouvel ordre"
msgstr[1] "boucliers du nouvel ordre"
msgstr[2] "boucliers du nouvel ordre"

#. ~ Description of "new order shield"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A simple shield made of some sort of polycarbonates, used extensively by the"
" Vigilants, the gendarmerie of the New Order.  Alongside their infamous "
"shock batons, this is an essential tool in 'keeping the peace'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/obsolete.json
msgid "new order battle shield"
msgid_plural "new order battle shields"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "new order battle shield"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/obsolete.json
msgid ""
"A well forged shield made of steel, emblazoned with what appears to be a "
"highly stylized depiction of a sword piercing a star."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of species "ALIEN"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/species.json
msgid "an alien invader"
msgstr "un envahisseur extraterrestre"

#. ~ Description of species "WILDALIEN"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/species.json
msgid "an alien animal"
msgstr "un animal extraterrestre"

#. ~ Description of species "BIOCRYSTAL"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/species.json
msgid "a fusion of flesh and mineral"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "alien metal scrap"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"Scraps of some sort of alien metal of varying sizes, light but tough.  It's "
"quite pretty to look at, silvery with faint blue and green undertones.  "
"Makes a decent weapon in a pinch and is useful for crafting recipes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid "alien cloth scrap"
msgid_plural "alien cloth scraps"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "alien cloth scrap"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"This is a sizable portion of fibrous synthetic cloth, flexible and "
"resistant, but unpleasant to the touch.  Useful in crafting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid "alien polymer scrap"
msgid_plural "alien polymer scraps"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "alien polymer scrap"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"This is a collection of strange, ivory colored plastics that are unnervingly"
" warm to the touch.  It could be used to fabricate, repair, or reinforce."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid "alien electronic scrap"
msgid_plural "alien electronic scraps"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "alien electronic scrap"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"A collection of dazzling alien electronics, far beyond anything of "
"terrestrial manufacture.  Useful in crafting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid "alien biotech"
msgid_plural "alien biotechs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "alien biotech"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"A fistful of gently squirming parts that secrete viscous gel.  Useful in "
"crafting, but not fun to hold."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid "alien power cell"
msgid_plural "alien power cells"
msgstr[0] "cellule d'énergie extraterrestre"
msgstr[1] "cellules d'énergie extraterrestres"
msgstr[2] "cellules d'énergie extraterrestres"

#. ~ Description of "alien power cell"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"A fist-sized, cylindrical canister that makes you feel a bit tingly when you"
" hold it.  Its center houses a faintly glowing red core of some sort.  "
"Though fundamentally incompatible with earthly technologies, it still might "
"be useful in crafting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid "alien hydrogel"
msgid_plural "alien hydrogels"
msgstr[0] "hydrogel extraterrestre"
msgstr[1] "hydrogel extraterrestre"
msgstr[2] "hydrogel extraterrestre"

#. ~ Description of "alien hydrogel"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/alien-scrap.json
msgid ""
"A lump of alien hydrogel with small writhing specks in it.  Useful in "
"crafting.  You could 'drink' it, but there's no way it would be pleasant."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid "broken emissary"
msgid_plural "broken emissaries"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "broken emissary"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"The massive body of a collapsed emissary.  Still a bit intimidating, perhaps"
" knowing the damage it can cause.  Could be gutted for parts, but you'll "
"probably need specialized alien tools."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid "broken emissary of plague"
msgid_plural "broken emissaries of plague"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "broken emissary of plague"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"The massive body of a collapsed emissary of plague.  Still a bit "
"intimidating, perhaps knowing the damage it can cause.  Could be gutted for "
"parts, but you'll probably need specialized alien tools."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid "broken emissary of flame"
msgid_plural "broken emissaries of flame"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "broken emissary of flame"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"The massive body of a collapsed emissary of flame.  Still a bit "
"intimidating, perhaps knowing the damage it can cause.  Could be gutted for "
"parts, but you'll probably need specialized alien tools."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid "broken surveillance drone"
msgid_plural "broken surveillance drones"
msgstr[0] "drone de surveillance détruit"
msgstr[1] "drones de surveillance détruits"
msgstr[2] "drones de surveillance détruits"

#. ~ Description of "broken surveillance drone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A broken drone.  Much less threatening now that it isn't shining its light "
"everywhere.  Could be gutted for parts.  Specialized alien tools would be "
"best for disassembly, but you could make do with more human instruments "
"instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid "broken seeker drone"
msgid_plural "broken seeker drones"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of "broken seeker drone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A broken drone.  Much less threatening now that it isn't prodding you.  "
"Specialized alien tools would be best for disassembly, but you could make do"
" with more human instruments instead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "active alien bomb"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mapgen/map_extras/bombed_crater.json
msgid ""
"This is an alien bomb.  It has been activated and will soon explode, "
"delivering its entire destructive power to everything in sight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mapgen/map_extras/bombed_crater.json
msgid "Bomb Crater"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of map extra "Bomb Crater"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mapgen/map_extras/bombed_crater.json
msgid "A bomb crater."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of map extra
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mapgen/map_extras/patrols.json
msgid "DSA ALRP"
msgstr "DSA ALRP"

#. ~ Description of map extra "DSA ALRP"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mapgen/map_extras/patrols.json
msgid "Alien light reconnaissance patrol."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "emissary"
msgid_plural "emissaries"
msgstr[0] "émissaire"
msgstr[1] "émissaires"
msgstr[2] "émissaires"

#. ~ Description of monster "emissary"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"A towering, metallic creature with a stunningly beautiful design and "
"brilliantly shining etchings, standing atop three segmented legs.  The "
"tentacles that drift off of its central chassis are tipped with strange "
"looking devices as it strides slowly across the shattered landscape.  This "
"one seems less aggressive than those seen on the front-lines of the Arrival,"
" studying its surroundings and probing things in the environment with a "
"variety of internal tools, though it is infamous for kidnapping anyone it "
"comes across.  A sickeningly sweet gas hangs around it that makes you feel "
"woozy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "emissary"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "The emissary emits a stream of sedative gas!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "emissary"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "the sound of pressurized gas hissing loudly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "emissary"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "emissary of pestilence"
#. ~ No ammo sound of special attack of monster "emissary of flame"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "a roar!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "emissary of pestilence"
msgid_plural "emissaries of pestilence"
msgstr[0] "émissaire de pestilence"
msgstr[1] "émissaires de pestilence"
msgstr[2] "émissaires de pestilence"

#. ~ Description of monster "emissary of pestilence"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"A towering, stories-tall metallic creature standing atop three long legs "
"connected to a central chassis.  It would be stunningly beautiful with its "
"glowing golden inlays and celestial design, were it not for the gas that "
"pours from its tentacle-mounted guns that despoil the landscape around it. "
"It makes your skin prickle just looking at its toxic, likely radioactive, "
"glory.  Its hums hauntingly as it moves, its footsteps booming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "emissary of pestilence"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "Putrid gas rolls across the landscape!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "emissary of pestilence"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "an ominous rumble and hiss of gas."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "emissary of flame"
msgid_plural "emissaries of flame"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "emissary of flame"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"Like all emissaries, this breathtaking metallic creature stands atop three "
"long legs, with many more segmented tentacles emanating from its central "
"chassis and a glowing halo about its head.  This one is far more terrifying "
"than its peers: its claim to fame being some sort of high-intensity energy "
"cannon mounted under its chassis.  Its unique chirping and booming footsteps"
" heralded destruction during the Arrival, and now is no different."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "emissary of flame"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "Sound returns as the emissary's cannon roars to life!!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Targeting sound of special attack of monster "emissary of flame"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "the air pressure suddenly drop as the emissary charges its cannon!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "recycler"
msgid_plural "recyclers"
msgstr[0] "recycleur"
msgstr[1] "recycleurs"
msgstr[2] "recycleurs"

#. ~ Description of monster "recycler"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"A sleek mass of hairy tentacles originate from a metallic core that looks "
"like a mix between a garbage disposal and a clamp, golden pinpoints of dim "
"light dotting its chassis.  It seems adept at collecting small pieces of "
"junk and debris to mulch them into their base parts - you included."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "tunneler"
msgid_plural "tunnelers"
msgstr[0] "tunnelier"
msgstr[1] "tunneliers"
msgstr[2] "tunneliers"

#. ~ Description of monster "tunneler"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"A huge creature, encased in metal plating and covered in small golden "
"\"eyes\".  Stocky robotic appendages covering its body allow it to smash "
"through rock and propel itself forward with efficiency.  Its interior seems "
"to have been replaced by some sort of whirring processing equipment that "
"would be highly unpleasant to be caught up in.  Fortunately it doesn't seem "
"immediately interested in you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid "alien skirmisher"
msgid_plural "alien skirmishers"
msgstr[0] "tirailleur alien"
msgstr[1] "tirailleurs alien"
msgstr[2] "tirailleurs alien"

#. ~ Description of monster "alien skirmisher"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_cyborgs.json
msgid ""
"A slouched bipedal figure, slightly smaller than an average adult human.  "
"Beneath woven full-body combat armor and a full suite of cybernetic "
"modifications are glimpses of rubbery, abscessed flesh.  It is capable of "
"short, boosted jumps using a device on its back, closing gaps to cause havoc"
" with its wicked integrated melee weapons.  Severed organic parts dangle "
"from its equipment, morbid trophies from past battles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid "sewer lurker"
msgid_plural "sewer lurkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "sewer lurker"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A dripping creature, a serpentine body with a mass of tentacles attached to "
"a gnashing maw, this thing seems to have found its home among trash and "
"sewage.  It is an ambush predator, preferring to lurk just beneath the "
"cloudy water before something comes close enough to snag with its long "
"tentacles."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid "lurker"
msgid_plural "lurkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "lurker"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A long, serpentine body, dark and murky just like the waters it inhabits.  "
"Tendrils trail behind it, framing innumerable teeth in a gnashing central "
"mouth.  It prefers to lurk just below the surface, drifting and still, like "
"an unassuming piece of flotsam until something gets too close."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid "moss lizard"
msgid_plural "moss lizards"
msgstr[0] "lézard moussu"
msgstr[1] "lézards moussus"
msgstr[2] "lézards moussus"

#. ~ Description of monster "moss lizard"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A cow-sized reptiloid, covered in what appears to be a thick layer of mossy "
"vegetation and rocks.  It trudges about the landscape on sturdy legs, "
"foraging whatever flora it can reach with sharp little teeth.  It doesn't "
"seem to mind you too much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid "pack lizard"
msgid_plural "pack lizards"
msgstr[0] "lézard de meute"
msgstr[1] "lézards de meute"
msgstr[2] "lézards de meute"

#. ~ Description of monster "pack lizard"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A slim reptiloid about the size of a big dog, with a rather pretty, thick, "
"orange-blue mane of what look like 'feathers' around its head.  Frond-like "
"protrusions grow from the top of its head down to the base of its tail, "
"glowing faintly when in the presence of other members of its pack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid "wisp"
msgid_plural "wisp"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "wisp"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A small, fist sized critter that looks like a floating slug covered in bio-"
"luminescent markings, capable of limited flight through utilization of "
"membranous, winglike protrusions and the secretion of a faint white mist.  "
"It is most commonly found around zipping around flowers, fruits, and other "
"sugary substances in small, communal groups.  It regards you with curiosity,"
" occasionally flashing its markings at you as if trying to communicate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid "bileworm"
msgid_plural "bileworms"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bileworm"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_fauna.json
msgid ""
"A large creature that smells like death, befitting its preferred diet of "
"carrion and other rotting organic material, though it may attack wounded "
"prey if pressed.  It is capable of both burrowing and limited land travel, "
"with the help of a multitude of stocky appendages that surround its mouth "
"and line its body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
msgid "alien dispatch system"
msgid_plural "alien dispatch systems"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "alien dispatch system"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous intelligence, capable of teleporting drones and skirmishers to "
"the planet, or dispatching larger aliens in drop pods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
msgid "alien surveillance drone"
msgid_plural "alien surveillance drones"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "alien surveillance drone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
msgid ""
"A small, sleek, white-plated robot bearing a golden insignia that is capable"
" of limited flight.  It hovers about the ruins of the former world, onboard "
"cameras and spotlights impartial witness to the chaos around it.  Who knows "
"might be watching on the other side…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
msgid "alien seeker drone"
msgid_plural "alien seeker drones"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "alien seeker drone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
msgid ""
"A small, sleek, white-plated robot bearing a golden insignia that is capable"
" of limited flight.  It hovers about the ruins of the former world, using a "
"suite of sharp retractable tools, a bright camera flash, and integrated "
"'arms' to manipulate the world around it.  It seems to watch its subjects "
"closely…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "alien seeker drone"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/alien_robots.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s blinds %3$s with its integrated camera!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray"
msgid_plural "strays"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A former human; a hateful shadow of its former self capable of violent "
"outbursts of fury.  Large patches of cyan-purple crystals grow out of its "
"bruised flesh, slowly overtaking it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray cop"
msgid_plural "stray cops"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray cop"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A former law enforcer, no doubt deployed to help civilians evacuate during "
"the Arrival.  Unfortunately, despite their best efforts, many were still "
"infested.  It is still clad from head to toe in light body armor, partially "
"overtaken by crystal."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray soldier"
msgid_plural "stray soldiers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray soldier"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A former soldier, no doubt deployed to assist with evacuations and drive off"
" the aliens, dressed from head to toe in partially crystallized combat "
"armor.  Though their training could not have prepared them for what they "
"were up against, they still seem to remember enough to take you on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray firefighter"
msgid_plural "stray firefighters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray firefighter"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A former human body clad in tattered first responder gear, wet-sounding "
"breath gurgling through the gas mask encrusted to its face.  Staggering "
"around the community it once served, it is little more than yet another host"
" for the crystal infestation."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "hungry stray"
msgid_plural "hungry strays"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "hungry stray"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"An obese former human, body studded with irregular crystal growths deforming"
" its body.  It howls in hunger as it wanders, seeking new meals to add to "
"its bulk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray rockfeeder"
msgid_plural "stray rockfeeders"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray rockfeeder"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A swollen and misshapen body pierced from the inside by rocky growths, the "
"lower half of its face nothing a distended jaw full of gnashing, crystalline"
" teeth.  It lets out bloodcurdling howls of pain and constantly drips a "
"foul-smelling slurry of rocky sludge and bile."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray crystaltender"
msgid_plural "stray crystaltenders"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray crystaltender"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"Little more than a mobile mound of crystal and meat that occasionally spits "
"up a tide of glowing, rocky gruel from its many cracks and crevices, this "
"crab-like creature trudges to and fro bearing a heavy burden.  From just "
"behind the murky surfaces of its shell, you can almost make out small, "
"moving creatures skittering about in its complex innards.  It seems to stay "
"close to other crystal creatures, pouring the goop it secretes onto them "
"like some sort of caretaker.  When threatened it is capable of producing "
"harrowing screams, no doubt drawing its friends to its aid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "crackling stray"
msgid_plural "crackling strays"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "crackling stray"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A hunched human form, back bristling with a hedge of buzzing blue crystals."
"  Its veins visibly glow with some sort of unearthly substance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "arcing stray"
msgid_plural "arcing strays"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "arcing stray"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A deformed multi-legged creature, its once terrestrial body now merely a "
"platform for the massive crystalline pylons that jut from its torso where "
"its head once was.  Its arms dangle uselessly at its sides, but it is more "
"than capable of simply ramming its prey to deliver dangerous electric "
"shocks."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray sprinter"
msgid_plural "stray sprinters"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray sprinter"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"This well-toned, agile former human was once an athletic figure, and appears"
" to have retained some of its wit to boot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray prowler"
msgid_plural "stray prowlers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray prowler"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"This tightly-wound mutant now moves like some sort of animal, sometimes on "
"two legs and sometimes on four.  Its mouth gapes menacingly with tusks of "
"polished stone, and its fingers gleam with crystal-fused claws."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray guardian"
msgid_plural "stray guardians"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray guardian"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"Lithe muscle and pulsating crystal fused together into a mass that must be "
"made up of multiple bodies, propelled forward by multiple grossly elongated "
"crystal limbs sharpened to dangerous points.  It strides about the streets, "
"spearing those who dare intrude on its domain like some sort of horrid "
"spider from beyond the stars."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray bruiser"
msgid_plural "stray bruisers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray bruiser"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A former human, athletic and toned, body girded with thick crystal armor "
"that pulsates as if alive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray golem"
msgid_plural "stray golems"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray golem"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A human that has grown considerably in stature after absorbing plenty of "
"additional biomass, now at least ten feet tall and covered in rocky plates "
"that make it seem more mineral than human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray titan"
msgid_plural "stray titans"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray titan"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"This towering mass of fused flesh and crystal is humanoid, but its towering "
"height is anything but.  It crushes everything that stands in its way with "
"club-like 'hands' that are even bigger than you are and easily throws aside "
"anything in its way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray waif"
msgid_plural "stray waifs"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray waif"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A small, quick mutant, most likely once a human child, now disfigured by "
"patches of crystal.  Their features are still recognizable enough to make "
"the thought of putting them down cause your gut to churn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray creep"
msgid_plural "stray creeps"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray creep"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A terrifying, hairy husk of a creature scrambling about on all fours, a "
"mongrel house pet or the like covered in patches of crystal growths that jut"
" from it like spikes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray wretch"
msgid_plural "stray wretches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray wretch"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"This blur of jagged, crystal-fused limbs and hair could have been anything "
"from a house pet to a human at some point, but now it leaps and skitters "
"around like something out of a nightmare."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray stalker"
msgid_plural "stray stalkers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray stalker"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A wolf-sized creature made of thick slabs of crystal, small fleshy tendrils "
"drifting off of it like cilia.  It seems more than happy to tear the life "
"out of anything unfortunate enough to cross its path, to drag back to its "
"'family'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "flailing wretch"
msgid_plural "flailing wretches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "flailing wretch"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A person-sized mass of writhing, barbed tendrils that barely seems like it "
"could have once been any terrestrial animal, originating from a barely "
"visible mass of central crystal.  It slithers across the ground, snatching "
"up organic matter to bring back to feed to its smaller companions so that "
"they, too, may grow larger."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "crackling wretch"
msgid_plural "crackling wretches"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "crackling wretch"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A flailing mass of tendrils and burnt hair that quickly skitters across the "
"ground like an insect, arched back bristling with loudly arcing crystal "
"spears."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "stray wretchmother"
msgid_plural "stray wretchmothers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "stray wretchmother"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A large, crystal-packed creature capable of massive, bounding leaps like "
"some sort of alien wolf.  Its topmost layer of crystal sprouts several "
"flailing, fleshy tendrils, which pull anything they can reach into the "
"gnashing maw just under its body.  Something else, just as unseemly, writhes"
" just beneath the murky surface of its glassy body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "germinating crystal mass"
msgid_plural "germinating crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "germinating crystal mass"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A little bulb of crystal rooted into the earth through dirt and concrete "
"alike, noodle-like tendrils squirming across the ground, grabbing any little"
" bit of organic matter it can find and drawing it to its base."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "sprouting crystal mass"
msgid_plural "sprouting crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "sprouting crystal mass"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A human-sized mound of shimmering bluish-purple crystals growing on the base"
" of what looks like a mound of foul smelling garbage and organic leftovers."
"  Long, thin tendrils appear to grow out of the mound, and are subtly "
"rooting down into the ground below it, boring through dirt and concrete "
"alike.  It crackles weakly with electrical energy.  If you look closely, it "
"almost looks like something wet and meaty is squirming just inside the inner"
" shell of crystals…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "resonant crystal mass"
msgid_plural "resonant crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "resonant crystal mass"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A set of rail-thin crystals growing haphazardly from a mound of rock and "
"composted organic matter, fastened in place by thick strands of bizarre "
"alien material.  The buzzing of natural energy playing among the tines seems"
" to culminate in an almost musical sound.  While pleasant at a distance, "
"this can transform into a deafening, high-pitched whine when it feels "
"threatened."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "flailing crystal mass"
msgid_plural "flailing crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "flailing crystal mass"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A tall, singular crystal, growing out of a sizable pile of debris that has "
"sprouted a multitude of thin, whip-like tendrils that constantly snake "
"around it like feelers.  It frequently grabs nearby objects and drags them "
"into the pile beneath it, as if hoarding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "energized crystal mass"
msgid_plural "energized crystal masses"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "energized crystal mass"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A crooked, fiercely glowing bluish-purple crystal that visibly discharges "
"electricity into the surrounding environment without any discernible intent."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "crystal mass wall"
msgid_plural "crystal mass walls"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "crystal mass wall"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A massive wall of thick, blocky crystals that glow faintly and crackle with "
"residual electric energy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "crystal mass hive"
msgid_plural "crystal mass hives"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "crystal mass hive"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A towering mass of bluish-purple crystal chunks covered in small, fist-sized"
" holes, from which drips a disgusting, faintly glowing rock slurry - perhaps"
" a nutrient mix for its young.  After all, it seems to subtly pulsate, as if"
" more organic than its mineral appearance would suggest.  The air around it "
"perpetually crackles with palpable energy, and it waves a set of thick, "
"meaty tendrils with razor-like barbs through the air, with something else "
"just as unseemly writhing just beneath the murky surface of the glassy "
"'rocks'."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "crystal seed"
msgid_plural "crystal seeds"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "crystal seed"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A tiny, multi-legged creature that appears to be made of a chunk of crystal."
"  It skitters around on wire-like legs, eating bits of organic leftovers.  "
"Possibly to gain mass in hopes of one day seeding a crystal colony of its "
"own."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid "engorged crystal seed"
msgid_plural "engorged crystal seeds"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "engorged crystal seed"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/monsters/strays.json
msgid ""
"A swollen crystal seed, now grown to about the size of a cat, heavy enough "
"with accumulated biomass to settle down and begin germinating into a proper "
"crystal mass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid "RP: Combatant"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "RP: Combatant"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You've seen your fair share of scruffs and scrapes, and when the Cataclysm "
"hit, you fought the Occupiers and managed to survive to tell the tale.  Has "
"no direct skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a fighter to "
"certain NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid "RP: Medic"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "RP: Medic"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Your job or experiences had you seeing all sorts of trauma, both physical "
"and mental, and you were trusted during the Cataclysm to provide life-saving"
" care.  Has no direct skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a"
" healer to certain NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid "RP: Leader"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "RP: Leader"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Whether or not you like it, you've always had a knack for managing people "
"and have some hard-won skill in doing so.  During the arrival and the "
"ensuing chaos, you helped lead people around you to safety.  Has no direct "
"skill benefit, but allows you to present yourself as a leader to certain "
"NPCs.  Some might even recognize you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Heroin Addict"
msgstr "Héroïnomane"

#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Addict" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then the skies opened up and fire rained forth.  This doesn't feel like a "
"fever dream."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Heroin Addict"
msgstr "Héroïnomane"

#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Addict" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then the skies opened up and fire rained forth.  This doesn't feel like a "
"fever dream."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Addict" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers started growing "
"crystals, satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Heroin Addict" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers started growing "
"crystals, satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For some reason you are now completely naked!  Maybe you were robbed, maybe "
"you were in a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of "
"liberation brought upon the wind touching your skin, whatever it is, you "
"lack clothes in a time when the aliens are searching for prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Naked and Afraid" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For some reason you are now completely naked!  Maybe you were robbed, maybe "
"you were in a nudist beach, or maybe you just enjoy the feeling of "
"liberation brought upon the wind touching your skin, whatever it is, you "
"lack clothes in a time when the aliens are searching for prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjack" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect those crystal ghouls aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lumberjack" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect those crystal ghouls aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Aliens "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Ballroom Dancer" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Aliens "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Rude Boy" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer got vaporized.  Now you're alone in"
" the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Rude Girl" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer got vaporized.  Now you're alone in"
" the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Imam" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community "
"in prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you; now they"
" come to tear you apart."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Mourchida" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community "
"in prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you; now they"
" come to tear you apart."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Teacher" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If aliens have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Teacher" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If aliens have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Landscaper" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Landscaper" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Nursing Assistant" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among those crystal things…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Nursing Assistant" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among those crystal things…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now aliens are killing everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Otaku" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now aliens are killing everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the aliens started "
"invading, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lawyer" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the aliens started "
"invading, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Boy" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to the local cryogenics lab "
"when hungry aliens attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety,"
" you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Vous livriez la dernière pizza de la nuit au laboratoire de cryogénie local "
"lorsque des extraterrestres peu commodes ont tenté de vous dévorer. Fuyant "
"pour vous mettre à l'abri, vous vous êtes retrouvé avec seulement votre "
"astuce et des restes de pizza. Et ils n'ont même pas laissé de pourboire!"

#. ~ Description of profession "Pizza Delivery Girl" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to the local cryogenics lab "
"when hungry aliens attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety,"
" you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Vous livriez la dernière pizza de la nuit au laboratoire de cryogénie local "
"lorsque des extraterrestres peu commodes ont tenté de vous dévorer. Fuyant "
"pour vous mettre à l'abri, vous vous êtes retrouvée avec seulement votre "
"astuce et des restes de pizza. Et ils n'ont même pas laissé de pourboire!"

#. ~ Description of profession "Relief Volunteer" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the storms picked up and the first bombs "
"dropped, you were eager to lend a hand.  But you had to cut your plans short"
" when the aliens arrived: they seem less interested in handouts, and more "
"interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez un membre d'une association à but non lucratif ayant pour "
"objectif d'aider partout ou de l'aide était requise. Lorsque les tempêtes "
"ont commencées et les premières bombes sont tombées, vous étiez prêt à aider"
" votre prochain, mais vous avez dû reconsidérer vos choix lorsque les "
"extraterrestres ont débarqués, moins intéressés par votre aide et plus "
"intéressés par votre chair."

#. ~ Description of profession "Relief Volunteer" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the storms picked up and the first bombs "
"dropped, you were eager to lend a hand.  But you had to cut your plans short"
" when the aliens arrived: they seem less interested in handouts, and more "
"interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Vous étiez une membre d'une association à but non lucratif ayant pour "
"objectif d'aider partout ou de l'aide était requise. Lorsque les tempêtes "
"ont commencées et les premières bombes sont tombées, vous étiez prête à "
"aider votre prochain, mais vous avez dû reconsidérer vos choix lorsque les "
"extraterrestres ont débarqués, moins intéressés par votre aide et plus "
"intéressés par votre chair."

#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous aliens."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez appris beaucoup de ces nombreuses années passées à voyager. En "
"temps normal vous pourriez répondre à toute question, mais vous n'avez pas "
"encore de réponses au sujet de ces extraterrestres."

#. ~ Description of profession "Guru" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous aliens."
msgstr ""
"Vous avez appris beaucoup de ces nombreuses années passées à voyager. En "
"temps normal vous pourriez répondre à toute question, mais vous n'avez pas "
"encore de réponses au sujet de ces extraterrestres."

#. ~ Description of profession "Preacher" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the aliens don't seem particularly moved by "
"your sermons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Preacher" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/professions.json
