#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic and managed to escape to "
"(relative) safety in one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Evacuee" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic and managed to escape to "
