msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for male
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of scenario "Surrounded" for female
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/overrides/scenarios.json
