msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"What the hell were they mining for in these shafts?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"fucking idiots with their medieval getups like that's gonna help against "
"PLASMA RIFLES\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"wish the rain kept up after they arrived.  made my funnel collection feel "
"more useful\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Libraries are useless after the apocalypse.  Can't read away the aliens.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I swear to God I've seen these aliens before!  In a game, or something!  I"
" swear…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Think it's worth it to crack a bank now that all the guards were killed or"
" sent off?\""
msgstr ""
"\"Tu penses que ce serait une bonne idée d'essayer de piller une banque "
"maintenant que tout les gardes sont morts ou partis?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"They're setting up in these big structures all over.  Looks like some shit"
" out of a sci-fi movie… goes without saying huh\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"i've seen what they've done to people who surrendered.  I don't know if "
"I'll be able to sleep right again…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"sometimes I wonder what would happen if I surrendered to one.  shitting in"
" a bucket sucks, man\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"how long were they watching us?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"couldn't even dent one with the .45. all the noise just made me a bigger "
"target.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Come to the bar if you see this, let's re-enact an alien movie, friends.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"here I was hoping for zombies hahahaha, feel like I was born into the "
"wrong apocalypse\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"It blacked out the sun for a while and rained hellfire.  Biblical.  What "
"the HELL are we supposed to do?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  Wish I was smart enough to finagle"
" that engine controller out of it… heard Scrapper Joe put one in his "
"deathmobile and now doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of "
"shit…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Crawled in through the vents.  Whole office building is a wreck.  Why the "
"hell they bomb it?  Just to kill people?  Deny resources and shelter?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"god help you if you get caught by one of those nasty blade things that "
"have been carving up wood.  my arm…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"OPFOR, occupiers, invaders, aliens, new gods, drones, bots.  Did I miss "
"any?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"remember lambda\""
msgstr "\"souvenez-vous de lambda\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"do NOT surrender.  if you're so lucky as to find any that won't rip you up"
" or shoot you on sight at this point, they do NOT have anything good in mind"
" for us\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"the finest army in the world.  problem is, they're the finest army off-"
"world.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"watch your six.  some of them can cloak.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"ALL HAIL THE NEW GODS\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Aliens crawling all over the place.  Have reinforcement points all over.  "
"Could take them out.  Might buy us some time in some places.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"wondering if firefighter gear would be a better idea.  they use a lot of "
"plasma, which is like, heat, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"they're definitely watching us.  stay alert\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"if you hear humming: run\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"get on the roofs.  they might see you but they can't climb.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"i'm running out of ink but listen you need to\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"mmm mmm delsihous alien drink\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"they've got robots for everything.  haven't seen a single gray.  some "
"aliens, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"at least they aren't quiet\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"ELTON MOOSEK DID THIS\""
msgstr "\"C'EST LA FAUTE D'ELTON MOOSEK\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"did you know?  alien wildlife is friendly to other aliens.  whoda thunk.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I'd like to thank my high-school culinary arts class for teaching me how "
"to make RDX.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"in my dreams i saw hordes of the walking dead and a guy named kevin "
"standing above it all, speaking in tongues.  glad it wasn't real\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"sometimes… I dream about cheese\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"mushy fucking pickles\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"war of the god damn worlds\""
msgstr "\"guerre des putains de mondes\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"made a movie out of some footage of the war.  a week days cut down into "
"seven hours.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Got split from my squad.  If you're reading this, meet me at the nearby "
"bunker.  Remember the password.  If not: I've got a bullet with your fucking"
" name on it.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"if anyones reading this, please tell my mom i was right about robots being"
" superior\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"heard a kid whispering to me from inside a garage.  i fucking bolted\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"This is all just a dream, right??!  I'M GOING TO WAKE UP, HE'S GOING TO BE"
" OK\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"I figured it out.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"can never have enough kevlar.  basically just live in a kevlar turtle "
"shell.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Glad you found this finally.  I've been watching you for a while.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"chin up brian\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"all it had to do was look at me WHAT THE FUCK DID IT DO TO ME\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"i think i've been here before\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Tried wearing one their suits of armor and they shot at me anyway.  It's "
"like they're, like, a hivemind, man.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"knock knock?  check the back window.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"for anyone reading:  no, SETI had nothing-to-fuck do with this\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"they put something in the water\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"the 50cal is strong with this one\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nothing left on the radio "
"but static.  Might as well throw this thing away…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"remember to bleach those bandages\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"parry this casuals\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"I've seen what they do with the bodies.  Their medical prowess is "
"staggering…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"You're next.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"anyone else want to go down in a blaze of glory?  join me at the park.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting the aliens, managing"
" the fields, outrunning the new 'wildlife', and more.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"it wasn't even a person anymore im sorry god\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the "
"people we're having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't "
"robots, it's just power armor!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"Two words: Truman Show.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"For sale: baby shoes, unused\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing "
"where the bots are going.  I think I saw the explosion a mile away after "
"they caught wind.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid "\"preppers picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"The fewer 'resistance members' in New England, the stronger we'll become "
"out here in the wilds.  Let them die.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "dks_note"
#: data/mods/Dark-Skies-Above/snippets/survnotes.json
msgid ""
"\"Take this little token as a sign that I was here too, and I took something"
" really good.\""
msgstr ""

#. ~ Speech from speaker mon_dks_emissary, mon_dks_emissary_war,
#. mon_dks_emissary_flame
