"A TALON unmanned ground vehicle equipped with a standard assault rifle.  It "
"is a small tracked UGV with an array of motors and sensors covering its "
"weapon mount."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/active_bots.json
