#. ~ Description of "CROWS II, heavy machinegun"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/inactive_bots.json
msgid ""
"This is an inactive turret.  Using this item involves loading the unit with "
"the factory-loaded ball heavy machine gun ammunition rounds in your "
"inventory (if you wish to divide your ammunition, set aside whatever "
"ammunition you do NOT want to give the turret) turning it on, and placing it"
" on the ground, where it will attach itself.  If programmed successfully the"
" turret will then identify you as a friendly, and attack all enemies with "
"its heavy machine gun."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/robots/inactive_bots.json
