#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_mammal.json
msgid ""
"A small and elusive canid native to South and Central America.  It is "
"harmless to humans but their packs can take on prey several times their "
"size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
